// The Tailscale client reaches github.com/tailscale/certstore on macOS and Windows for one
// feature Marshal does not use: a machine certificate from an administrator device policy. The
// upstream store talks to the Keychain through C, and this daemon builds without cgo (see
// docs/progress-tracker.md and third_party/certstore). This replacement answers "not available"
// instead, so `go build ./...` links and tailscale.com still compiles unchanged.
replace github.com/tailscale/certstore => ./third_party/certstore
